  "name": "BelPro — Mesečna Poročila",
  "description": "",
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BelPro — Mesečna poročila\n\n**Samodejni zagon:** vsak 28. v mesecu ob 07:00 (Europe/Ljubljana).\n**Ročni zagon:** klik 'Execute workflow' v n8n UI ali prek upravitelja poročil v BelPro.\n\nWorkflow pokliče `POST /api/reports/send-monthly`, ki:\n- generira individualni PDF za vsakega aktivnega prostovoljca z odobrenimi vnosi\n- pošlje PDF prostovoljcem z `report_email = True`\n- generira in pošlje skupno poročilo upravljalcu, če ima `report_email = True`\n\n**Zahteva credential:** `BelPro API (Basic Auth)` tipa HTTP Basic Auth\n- Uporabniško ime: `manager`\n- Geslo: vrednost `MANAGER_PASSWORD` iz `.env`"
      },
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 28 * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-schedule",
      "name": "28. v mesecu ob 07:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        208,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Ročni Zagon",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        464
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://api:8000/api/reports/send-monthly",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-send",
      "name": "Pošlji Mesečna Poročila",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        464,
        384
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "UqZlwzClZfiYKanN",
          "name": "BelPro API (Basic Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const result = $input.first().json;\nconst sent = result.sent_to_volunteers || [];\nconst errors = result.errors || [];\n\nconst lines = [\n  `BelPro mesečna poročila — ${result.month}/${result.year}`,\n  `Poslano prostovoljcem: ${sent.length}`,\n  `Upravljalec obveščen: ${result.manager_sent ? 'Da' : 'Ne'}`,\n  `Preskočeni (brez vnosov): ${(result.skipped_no_entries || []).length}`,\n  `Preskočeni (brez e-pošte): ${(result.skipped_no_email || []).length}`,\n];\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  lines.push(`NAPAKE (${errors.length}):`);\n  errors.forEach(e => lines.push('  ' + e));\n}\n\nconsole.log(lines.join('\\n'));\nreturn [{ json: result }];\n"
      },
      "id": "code-log",
      "name": "Zabeleži Rezultat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        704,
